      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "HI, I encountered the same issue too. I recorded my investigation in this discussion post ( https://ask.vrchat.com/t/how-to-get-lens-flare-working-in-vrchat-game/20490 )\n\nIt's the exact same situation as you described. When I'm on Quest, I cannot see the lens flare but if I put out a camera, the lens flare is visible in the camera. I thought this is a problem for all platforms, but later I find out the flare is visible for my steamVR friend.\n\nBased on my investigation, I notice the player camera does not receive a lens layer as indicated by reference camera. This is probably the cause of the problem.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
