      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently, I'm trying to use particle system to mimic a simple 1 texture flare. Sun flare with multiple texture is really beautiful, but I cannot think of any ways to mimic it right now. This is upsetting me.\n\nLens flare is within VRChat allowed world components, and it is not mentioned in the quest limitation section. This should be considered as a bug if it's not working. Lens flare is such a beautiful thing, it will be such a pity if it's not working.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
