  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As the title suggests, flares do not appear in the Oculus store version of VRChat while in VR mode. They can, however, be seen while looking through the camera. They also sometimes work in desktop mode, though not always. This is not a problem in the SteamVR version of VRChat.\nVRChat 2020.4.4p3",
